#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-flightmode.rst:5
#: e12f0a6505cc486195246d32ab78abd9
msgid "Get and Set FlightMode"
msgstr "获取与设置飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-flightmode.rst:7
#: b38f782d2d6f4dac872a3d18f475a73e
msgid ""
"This page explains how MAVLink can be used by a ground station or companion "
"computer to get or set the vehicle's flightmode.  The user wiki pages for "
"flightmodes and links to the parameter with the flightmode's numbers are "
"listed below"
msgstr "本页说明地面站或伴随计算机如何使用 MAVLink 获取或设置飞行器的飞行模式。下方列出了飞行模式用户文档页面及飞行模式编号参数的链接。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-flightmode.rst:9
#: b7b7d7948b074a80b53e6de7d6ee2337
msgid ""
":ref:`Copter flight modes <copter:flight-modes>`, see :ref:`FLTMODE1 "
"<copter:FLTMODE1>` for flightmode numbers"
msgstr ""
":ref:`多旋翼飞行模式 <copter:flight-modes>`，飞行模式编号参见 :ref:`FLTMODE1 "
"<copter:FLTMODE1>`"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-flightmode.rst:10
#: 9c5a8594647647dc95da2644541ea323
msgid ""
":ref:`Plane flight modes <plane:flight-modes>`, see :ref:`FLTMODE1 "
"<plane:FLTMODE1>` for flightmode numbers"
msgstr ""
":ref:`固定翼飞行模式 <plane:flight-modes>`，飞行模式编号参见 :ref:`FLTMODE1 "
"<plane:FLTMODE1>`"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-flightmode.rst:11
#: a10238abecda4a86b80d012976d8c713
msgid ""
":ref:`Rover flight modes <rover:rover-control-modes>`, see :ref:`MODE1 "
"<rover:MODE1>` for flightmode numbers"
msgstr ""
":ref:`地面车飞行模式 <rover:rover-control-modes>`，飞行模式编号参见 :ref:`MODE1 "
"<rover:MODE1>`"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-flightmode.rst:13
#: 75bd36e35dcd427ba0c655496bf06ee5
msgid ""
"The MAVLink enums for flight modes can be found `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink/blob/master/message_definitions/v1.0/ardupilotmega.xml#L1072>`__"
msgstr ""
"飞行模式的 MAVLink 枚举值可在 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/mavlink/blob/master/message_definitions/v1.0/ardupilotmega.xml#L1072>`__"
" 找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-flightmode.rst:16
#: 75212b3a52e642309693781b0ab36b68
msgid "Get the Flightmode with HEARTBEAT"
msgstr "通过 HEARTBEAT 获取飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-flightmode.rst:18
#: 3eb7f35e65af4853ad6a3c401fbce395
msgid ""
"The vehicle's current flight mode is sent once per second within the "
"`HEARTBEAT <https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HEARTBEAT>`__ "
"message's custom_mode field.  The flightmode number varies by vehicle type "
"(e.g. Copter, Plane, Rover, etc) so please refer to the links above to "
"convert the custom_mode number to a human readable flightmode name."
msgstr ""
"飞行器当前飞行模式每秒通过 `HEARTBEAT "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#HEARTBEAT>`__ 消息的 custom_mode "
"字段发送一次。飞行模式编号因飞行器类型（如多旋翼、固定翼、地面车等）而异，请参阅上方链接将 custom_mode 编号转换为可读的飞行模式名称。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-flightmode.rst:21
#: 69657816abcc410a99ba90ea198afed7
msgid "Set the Flightmode with MAV_CMD_DO_SET_MODE"
msgstr "通过 MAV_CMD_DO_SET_MODE 设置飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-flightmode.rst:23
#: 521e04c31d6f496da96aacbaf81cf784
msgid ""
"Attempt to set the vehicle's flightmode by sending a `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__ with the "
"command and param2 fields set as specified for the `MAV_CMD_DO_SET_MODE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_SET_MODE>`__ command."
msgstr ""
"通过发送 `COMMAND_LONG "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#COMMAND_LONG>`__（其中 command 和 "
"param2 字段按照 `MAV_CMD_DO_SET_MODE "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_DO_SET_MODE>`__ "
"命令的规定设置）来尝试设置飞行器的飞行模式。"

#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-flightmode.rst:92
#: ../../source/docs/mavlink-get-set-flightmode.rst:181
#: 023e524f0d8c4e4c999fabd36a7dc9e5 862b814150db4e2d977c5d1e3d7ddf1b
